    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26146" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διατύπ-ωσις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full and perfect shape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551b2
			</span></i>; <i>configuration,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἀνδρείκελος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					72
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>system,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
				</span></i>
			
			<i>*Mens.</i><i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>vivid description,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				20.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>regulation, apportionment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(9).907.9
			</span></i> (Chalcis, <span class="entity">iv A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				14.455
			</span></i> (Catana, V <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Fay.</u>
				23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				63.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; <i>disposition</i> made by a legislator,
				<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				117.13
			</span></i>; by a testator, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.1.2
			</span></i>.</div>
